    <string name="dialog_stop_first_message">The console is read when enhancement starts, so switching while it runs has no effect - and it leaves RetroArch on the previous console\'s capture window.\n\nStopping also restores RetroArch\'s config. Wait for the notification to disappear before starting again.</string>
